"10. Form and contents of licences to drive- (1) Every learners licence and driving licence, except a driving licence issued under section 18, shall be in such form and shall contain such information as may be prescribed by the Central Government.
(2) A learner's licence or, as the case may be, driving license shall also be expressed as entitling the holder to drive a motor vehicle of one or more of the following classes,
namely:-
(a) to (c)....
(d) light motor vehicles;
(e) Transport vehicle;
(I) road roller;
(j) motor vehicle of a specified description.;
10.
